  "releaseNotes": "Pluggable cache providers (ICacheProvider): InMemoryCacheProvider (default), DistributedCacheProvider placeholder for Redis/Garnet, CompositeCacheProvider for L1+L2; parameterized queries for security and query plan caching; reflection caching for performance; [Key] attribute for PK + _id suffix convention for FK detection. v1.6.2: [Table] attribute is now optional - falls back to entity class name (PascalCase); [Column] attribute already optional - falls back to property name (PascalCase).",
